  "extraction_notes": "[text-pass] The paper reports nominal Eu doping levels (0-8 wt%) in AgSbTe2. XRD and SEM/EDX analysis indicate that Eu has very limited solubility and primarily forms secondary phases (Ag2Te and EuTe), so the doped_site is marked as 'unclear' as it does not substitute into the lattice in a standard way. Electrical conductivity values at room temperature were extracted from Table 1. [figure-pass p1-5] Data for 0 wt% and 4 wt% Eu samples were extracted from Fig. 3. Other compositions (2, 6, 8 wt%) were omitted for brevity as they follow similar trends. Values are visual estimates from the plots. ",
